<blockquote>
<p>I get the horror feeling you'd want to evoke out of, but broadening the scope of the issue really kinda sucks out any feelings of uneasiness/fear?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>That's fair, I will admit it leans more towards War then outright horror, so I've made an edit to the thing.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This actually sounds a lot more like a non-SCP article work, like a tale, or an incident report.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>When I came up with this idea I did think that, but I wanted to create an SCP object rather than an Incident report.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>I would like to see a lot more Foundation intervention here other than helping the USGOV amnesticize possibly the entire US population.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I should clarify, the uprising only occurs in that region of Nevada, it's not nationwide. The area itself was quite remote and they had been moving people away for years, so it mostly surviving soldiers who, for whatever reason, can't be brought into the fold. And I'm not not how the Foundation would be able to help without the USGOV compromising their belief they can handle the situation themselves</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This sounds… weirdly childish? It's basically the USGOV wanting to prove to the Foundation that they're as good as them, only to horribly screw it up by nuking their own land.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Exactly, that's the point. I am 100% aware it is childish and stubborn but it is exactly what the independence loving USA would do. They have already proven they're the top dogs in the world, with the Soviets in a close second, so they wanted to do the same for the anomalies. Plus I doubt the USGOV is super happy about relying on an external independent organisation for all their effective containment.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>You could focus on them being all friendly and all before WWII before their relationship is severely strained as seen from various logs of meetings between the POTUS and the leader of the cults?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I intend to convey this through a combination of diary entries and logs of meets between the POTUS and the leader of the cults.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
